/audio 'oracle suite' capabilities belong to the implementing leads while QA.SIM.* own the same metrics and simulation-validation is the declared oracle_author of C-PHYS/C-ANIM/C-AUDIO. GAM.AI.validation and RES.MGMT.validation put suites with implementers while C-NAV/C-RES name another oracle author. Unlike RND.MAT.validation they lack the 'hooks only' qualifier, contradicting the implementer-vs-oracle-author independence rule.\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"171903af-614d-4932-9748-4941d8f1a515","timestamp":"2026-09-30T09:46:57.754Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5d3f1177-286c-46b1-b7d2-7f3de23e93b5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
